# Copy to .leak-denylist (gitignored) and fill in. One regex per line,
# case-insensitive. Never commit the filled-in file.
#
# Clients and partners
# northwind
# People
# jane[ .]doe
# Private repositories and internal hostnames
# my-private-repo
# internal\.example\.com
# Ticket ids from your tracker
# ABC-[0-9]+
